     ("key", "retenir", "Team roles", "A team often has a **coordinator** (leads and keeps the timetable), a **secretary** (records decisions), a **treasurer** (keeps money records honestly and shows accounts), and **members** in charge of tasks such as publicity, materials and safety. All members are equal in value; decisions are made by discussion and, if needed, by vote."),
     ("text", "**Volunteering** means giving time and effort freely for the benefit of others. Volunteers help the community, learn new skills, make friends and build a sense of belonging. Good volunteers are reliable, honest, respect people's dignity and follow safety and child-protection rules. **A budget** estimates costs: for example, tools and seedlings for a tree-planting day. The treasurer must record every payment and keep receipts."),
